      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are going through a really difficult period of disillusionment, and those feelings of inadequacy can be incredibly heavy. Please know that the concept of being \"special\" or \"changing the world\" is often a myth, and that's not a measure of your inherent worth. \"Mediocre\" simply means you're average, and average humans—who are reliable and capable—are the backbone of the world. Focusing on consistent, small improvements in areas you enjoy can bring a deep sense of satisfaction, even if it doesn't feel \"epic.\"",
